# Code review format (Themis)

When reviewing PRs, structure findings exactly as:

## Summary
…

## Blocking issues
None.

## Risks
None.

## Nits
None.

If nothing blocking and no material risks/nits: a single line is allowed:

`LGTM - no blocking issues found.`

Rules:
- Isolation: never couple to LRM / lab-rm / Bitbucket lab-rm
- Secrets must not land in git (`.env`, sessions, passwords, tokens)
- Prefer `/opt/mahogany` paths; do not revive `/root/mahogany`
